DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     ddff complains and skips a file system it cannot stat, cannot
     open, cannot read a superblock from, or whose superblock
     does not pass its consistency check; it exits with status 1
     if any file system was skipped for such a reason, or if
     given an unrecognized option.
